dfcb51","source_start_index":160,"source_text":"《史记》：商君反死彤地。即此。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["权争","人事"],"content":"1秦孝公薨，子惠文王立。公子虔之徒告商君欲反，發吏捕之。商君亡之魏；魏人不受，復內之秦。商君乃與其徒之商於，發兵北擊鄭，秦人攻商君，殺之，車裂以徇，盡滅其家。","content_fanyi":"秦孝公去世，他的儿子秦惠文王即位。公子虔的党徒上书告发商君企图谋反，秦惠文王派官吏去抓捕他。商君逃亡到魏国；魏国人不肯收留，又把他送回秦国。商君于是与他的部属前往商於之地，发兵向北攻打郑县，秦国人攻打商君，将他杀死，处以车裂之刑示众，并诛灭了商鞅的全家。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦孝公薨，子惠文王立。公子虔之徒告商君欲反，发吏捕之。商君亡之魏；魏人不受，复内之秦。商君乃与其徒之商于，发兵北击郑，秦人攻商君，杀之，车裂以徇，尽灭其家。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":172,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c329810-db0e-11ef-80b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"商君","people_name_jianti_auto":"商君","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c343210-db0e-11ef-9044-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭水","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭水","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c343211-db0e-11ef-909f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴西","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇西","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c343212-db0e-11ef-81d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"首陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"首阳县","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c343213-db0e-11ef-88bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鳥鼠山","place_name_jianti_auto":"鸟鼠山","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c343214-db0e-11ef-95d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c343215-db0e-11ef-9725-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c343216-db0e-11ef-a7f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"相，息亮翻。水經：渭水出隴西首陽縣鳥鼠山，東流至秦都咸陽南。商君蓋臨此以論囚。決罪曰論。論，盧困翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"相，息亮翻。水经：渭水出陇西首阳县鸟鼠山，东流至秦都咸阳南。商君盖临此以论囚。决罪曰论。论，卢困翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c34320f-db0e-11ef-a7a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"顯王","people_name_jianti_auto":"显王","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c343219-db0e-11ef-8a85-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"商鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"商鞅","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c34321a-db0e-11ef-bad0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"商鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"商鞅","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c34321b-db0e-11ef-8780-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c34321c-db0e-11ef-b271-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c34321d-db0e-11ef-b090-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c34321e-db0e-11ef-9397-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按顯王十七年，秦以商鞅爲大良造；十九年，商鞅徙秦都咸陽，廢井田，開阡陌，平權量。二十一年，更賦稅法，爲相當在是年，至今年十年矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按显王十七年，秦以商鞅为大良造；十九年，商鞅徙秦都咸阳，废井田，开阡陌，平权量。二十一年，更赋税法，为相当在是年，至今年十年矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c343218-db0e-11ef-ac9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"百里奚","people_name_jianti_auto":"百里奚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c343221-db0e-11ef-bfa4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦穆公","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c343222-db0e-11ef-b0b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"五羖大夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"五羖大夫","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c343223-db0e-11ef-9bbe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c343224-db0e-11ef-abdf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"百里奚自賣以五羖羊之皮，爲人養牛；秦穆公舉以爲相，秦人謂之五羖大夫。羖，牡羊也。羖，音古。","note_content_jianti_auto":"百里奚自卖以五羖羊之皮，为人养牛；秦穆公举以为相，秦人谓之五羖大夫。羖，牡羊也。羖，音古。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c343220-db0e-11ef-815c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵简子","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c343226-db0e-11ef-9ea5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"引趙簡子之言。諾，應聲也。諤，謇直也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"引赵简子之言。诺，应声也。谔，謇直也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8c343225-db0e-11ef-960a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"百里奚","people_name_jianti_auto":"百里奚","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c343228-db0e-11ef-9dc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦繆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦缪公","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c343229-db0e-11ef-a3ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"百里傒","people_name_jianti_auto":"百里傒","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8c34322a-db0e-11ef-86d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"繆夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"缪夫人","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8c34322b-db0e-11ef-9bec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"百里傒","people_name_jianti_auto":"百里傒","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c34322c-db0e-11ef-8fc8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"繆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"缪公","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8c34322d-db0e-11ef-90b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"虞","place_name_jianti_auto":"虞","place_note":"山西平陸","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c34322e-db0e-11ef-b5aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c34322f-db0e-11ef-aea1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c343230-db0e-11ef-9075-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"虞","place_name_jianti_auto":"虞","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8c343231-db0e-11ef-a71c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8c343232-db0e-11ef-845f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c343233-db0e-11ef-8882-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宛","place_name_jianti_auto":"宛","place_note":"河南南陽","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c343234-db0e-11ef-9649-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8c343235-db0e-11ef-acef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟子：百里奚，虞人也，以食牛干秦繆公。今曰荊之鄙人，按史記：晉滅虞，執百里傒，爲秦繆夫人媵。百里傒亡秦走宛，楚鄙人執之；繆公以五羖羊皮贖之，以爲上大夫。傒，讀與奚同。繆，讀與穆同。媵，以證翻。宛，於元翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟子：百里奚，虞人也，以食牛干秦缪公。今曰荆之鄙人，按史记：晋灭虞，执百里傒，为秦缪夫人媵。百里傒亡秦走宛，楚鄙人执之；缪公以五羖羊皮赎之，以为上大夫。傒，读与奚同。缪，读与穆同。媵，以证翻。宛，于元翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"8c343227-db0e-11ef-a72b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"僖","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c343239-db0e-11ef-a375-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c34323a-db0e-11ef-b56b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c34323b-db0e-11ef-a16f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂左傳僖三十年與晉圍鄭也。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓左传僖三十年与晋围郑也。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8c343238-db0e-11ef-8758-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":5,"chapter_name":"避讳篇第五","chenzhu_chapter":"避讳为民国以前吾国特有之体制，故史书上之记载，有待于以避讳解释者甚众，不讲避讳学，不足以读中国之史也，吾昔撰《史讳举例》问世，职为是焉。胡身之生避讳最盛之朝，熟谙避讳掌故。其撰《通鉴释文辨误後序》，谓：“海陵所刊公休《释文》，以乌桓为乌元。宋朝钦宗讳桓，靖康之初，公休没久矣，安得预为钦宗讳！”即利用避讳以证史书伪讬之一法。其注《通鉴》，以避讳为训释者尤多。兹所采不过数十条，而避讳常识已略具于是矣。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":2,"chenzhu_text":"此避讳称异名。秦始皇父庄襄王名子楚，见司马贞《索隐》。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":7,"tongjian_id":"CH05-CZ002"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"惠公","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠公","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c34323e-db0e-11ef-a1fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"懷公","people_name_jianti_auto":"怀公","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c34323f-db0e-11ef-89d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文公","people_name_jianti_auto":"文公","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c343240-db0e-11ef-8db8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆公","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c343241-db0e-11ef-ac04-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆公","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8c343242-db0e-11ef-9c92-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鬬克","people_name_jianti_auto":"鬬克","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"8c343243-db0e-11ef-adb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太史公","people_name_jianti_auto":"太史公","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8c343244-db0e-11ef-8bd8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c343245-db0e-11ef-a54b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c343246-db0e-11ef-94e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c343247-db0e-11ef-91cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8c343248-db0e-11ef-9b0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c343249-db0e-11ef-b8a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c34324a-db0e-11ef-9c73-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8c34324b-db0e-11ef-a843-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"城濮","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8c34324c-db0e-11ef-a401-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8c34324d-db0e-11ef-9403-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崤","place_name_jianti_auto":"崤","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8c34324e-db0e-11ef-9931-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8c34324f-db0e-11ef-ac5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8c343250-db0e-11ef-907b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"8c343251-db0e-11ef-afb1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8c343252-db0e-11ef-a866-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c343253-db0e-11ef-85e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8c343254-db0e-11ef-a406-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"8c343255-db0e-11ef-b281-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三置晉君，謂立惠公、懷公、文公也。索隱曰：十二諸侯年表，穆公二十八年，會晉伐楚朝周；此云救荊，未詳。余按左傳，晉旣敗楚于城濮，又敗秦於崤，穆公使鬬克歸楚求成，所謂救荊禍，蓋指此也。秦諱楚，故其國記率謂楚爲「荊」。太史公取秦記爲史記，通鑑又因史記而成書，故亦以楚爲荊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三置晋君，谓立惠公、怀公、文公也。索隐曰：十二诸侯年表，穆公二十八年，会晋伐楚朝周；此云救荆，未详。余按左传，晋既败楚于城濮，又败秦于崤，穆公使鬬克归楚求成，所谓救荆祸，盖指此也。秦讳楚，故其国记率谓楚为「荆」。太史公取秦记为史记，通鉴又因史记而成书，故亦以楚为荆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":159,"tongjian_id":"8c34323d-db0e-11ef-b174-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古者車立乘，惟安車則坐乘耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"古者车立乘，惟安车则坐乘耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":169,"tongjian_id":"8c34325d-db0e-11ef-aded-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"周禮：輪人爲蓋。蓋，所以覆冒車上也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"周礼：轮人为盖。盖，所以复冒车上也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"8c34325e-db0e-11ef-a207-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記：鄰有喪，舂不相。註云：相杵者，以音聲相勸。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"记：邻有丧，舂不相。注云：相杵者，以音声相劝。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"8c343262-db0e-11ef-a415-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":5,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見上八年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c22eb11-db0e-11ef-bc51-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見上八年。嬖，卑義翻，又博計翻。監，甲暫翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见上八年。嬖，卑义翻，又博计翻。监，甲暂翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":229,"tongjian_id":"8c343265-db0e-11ef-bfd1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"轢，郞擊翻。車踐曰轢。","note_content_jianti_auto":"轹，郞击翻。车践曰轹。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":244,"tongjian_id":"8c343266-db0e-11ef-954d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"祝","people_name_jianti_auto":"祝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c343268-db0e-11ef-8763-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武王","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c343269-db0e-11ef-a98c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄帝","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c34326a-db0e-11ef-b72a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"祝，姓也。古有巫，史、祝之官，其子孫因以爲姓。或曰：武王封黃帝之後於祝，其子孫因氏焉。黥，其京翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"祝，姓也。古有巫，史、祝之官，其子孙因以为姓。或曰：武王封黄帝之后于祝，其子孙因氏焉。黥，其京翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":267,"tongjian_id":"8c343267-db0e-11ef-9a02-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逸詩也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逸诗也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":282,"tongjian_id":"8c34326b-db0e-11ef-a29a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c34326e-db0e-11ef-b6c2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"杜預曰：騈脅，合幹也。騈，步田翻。乘，繩證翻。驂，讀曰參。","note_content_jianti_auto":"杜预曰：騈胁，合干也。騈，步田翻。乘，绳证翻。骖，读曰参。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":313,"tongjian_id":"8c34326d-db0e-11ef-9566-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薛綜","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛综","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c343270-db0e-11ef-a4db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顧野王","people_name_jianti_auto":"顾野王","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c343271-db0e-11ef-a21a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"8c343272-db0e-11ef-9adb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8c343273-db0e-11ef-a38c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江","place_name_jianti_auto":"江","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c343274-db0e-11ef-bafc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"8c343275-db0e-11ef-ba68-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薛綜曰：闟之爲言函也，取四戟函車邊。此蓋令力士旁車而趨，有急則操翕戟以禦之也。後漢志有闟戟車。晉志：闟戟車，長戟邪偃在後。唐韻：戟名曰闟，音所及翻。史記正義曰：顧野王云：矛，鋋也。方言云：矛，吳、楚、江、淮之間謂之鋋。釋名曰：戟，格也，旁有枝格。旁車之旁，音步浪翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"薛综曰：闟之为言函也，取四戟函车边。此盖令力士旁车而趋，有急则操翕戟以御之也。后汉志有闟戟车。晋志：闟戟车，长戟邪偃在后。唐韵：戟名曰闟，音所及翻。史记正义曰：顾野王云：矛，鋋也。方言云：矛，吴、楚、江、淮之间谓之鋋。释名曰：戟，格也，旁有枝格。旁车之旁，音步浪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":325,"tongjian_id":"8c34326f-db0e-11ef-80ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逸書也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逸书也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":351,"tongjian_id":"8c34327c-db0e-11ef-a26e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝露易晞，言不久也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝露易晞，言不久也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":367,"tongjian_id":"8c34327e-db0e-11ef-833c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people"